  "displayName": "Hodge Projection Duel 3D v0.1",
  "description": "Two-player triune projection duel on an 8x8x8 cube. Each macro-player controls three cube-face projections; one primary move is mirrored through the other two projections as an all-or-nothing composite turn.",
